 * t=0s    worker=A  jobId=campaign:4821  active
 * t=30s   queue     jobId=campaign:4821  marked STALLED (lock expired, never renewed)
 * t=30s   worker=B  jobId=campaign:4821  active            <- re-delivered to worker B
 * t=~4m   worker=A  jobId=campaign:4821  batch complete
 * t=~4m   worker=B  jobId=campaign:4821  batch complete    <- every recipient sent twice
